<div id="S4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">VLMs:</span> The VLMs used in the experiments are all summarized in Table I. We mainly use two series of VLMs, namely LLaVA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib5" title="" class="ltx_ref">5</a>]</cite> and InternVL <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib53" title="" class="ltx_ref">53</a>]</cite>. For each VLM, the prompt <span id="S4.SS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">”Please give the textual description of the driving scenario.”</span> and the corner case image are used together as inputs to generate descriptions of the current scenario. In this work, all the descriptions are generated with four NVIDIA A800 GPUs.</p>
</div>
